    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Vector Quantization in the Brain: Grid-like Codes in <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Peng%2C+X">Xiangyuan Peng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dong%2C+X">Xingsi Dong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu%2C+S">Si Wu</a>
      
