    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        A tutorial on discovering and quantifying the effect of latent causal sources of multimodal EHR data
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Barbero-Mota%2C+M">Marco Barbero-Mota</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Strobl%2C+E+V">Eric V. Strobl</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Still%2C+J+M">John M. Still</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Stead%2C+W+W">William W. Stead</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lasko%2C+T+A">Thomas A. Lasko</a>
      
